## 2. Completed Backend Endpoints Matrix

Every backend endpoint documented in the specification is now connected:

| Module | Method | Endpoint | Purpose | Backend | Frontend Connection |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Rooms** | `POST` | `/api/rooms` | Create room | Developed | `apiService.createRoom` |
| **Rooms** | `GET` | `/api/rooms` | Get all rooms | Developed | `apiService.getRooms` (with accurate tenant-based occupant list) |
| **Rooms** | `GET` | `/api/rooms/{roomNo}` | Get single room | Developed | `apiService.getRoomByRoomNo` |
| **Rooms** | `PUT` | `/api/rooms/{roomNo}` | Edit room | Developed | `apiService.updateRoom` (with `RoomRequestDto` fields) |
| **Rooms** | `DELETE` | `/api/rooms/{roomNo}` | Delete room | Developed | `apiService.deleteRoom` + UI confirmation & error handling |
| **Tenants** | `POST` | `/api/tenants` | Create tenant | Developed | `apiService.addTenant` |
| **Tenants** | `GET` | `/api/tenants` | Get all tenants | Developed | `apiService.getTenants` |
| **Tenants** | `GET` | `/api/tenants/{uid}` | Get single tenant | Developed | `apiService.getTenantByUid` |
| **Tenants** | `GET` | `/api/tenants/room/{roomNo}` | Get tenants by room | Developed | `apiService.getTenantsByRoom` |
| **Tenants** | `PUT` | `/api/tenants/{uid}` | Edit tenant | Developed | `apiService.updateTenant` |
| **Tenants** | `DELETE` | `/api/tenants/{uid}` | Delete tenant | Developed | `apiService.deleteTenant` + UI Delete Tenant button |
| **Admissions** | `POST` | `/api/admissions` | Create enrollment | Developed | `apiService.createAdmission` |
| **Admissions** | `GET` | `/api/admissions` | Get all admissions | Developed | `apiService.getAdmissions` |
| **Admissions** | `GET` | `/api/admissions/{number}` | Get single admission | Developed | `apiService.getAdmissionByNumber` |
| **Admissions** | `PUT` | `/api/admissions/{number}/confirm` | Confirm admission (Paid) | Developed | `apiService.confirmAdmission` + UI Confirm button |
| **Admissions** | `DELETE` | `/api/admissions/{number}` | Cancel pending admission | Developed | `apiService.cancelAdmission` + UI Cancel button |

*(Modules not yet developed on the backend: Rent, Invoice, Payment, Ledger, Dashboard, Reports, Notifications, Auth — remain supported via the frontend service layer as per document notes).*

