## 3. UI Updates

- **[AdmissionsView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Biju%20K/Desktop/rum/frontend/src/components/admissions/AdmissionsView.tsx)**:
  - Added an **Actions** column in the Admissions Ledger.
  - Pending admissions now feature a **Confirm** button (transitions admission from `PENDING` to `PAID` via `PUT /api/admissions/{number}/confirm`) and a **Cancel** button (cancels pending enrollment via `DELETE /api/admissions/{number}`).
  - Confirmed admissions show a verified `PAID (Active)` badge.
- **[TenantsView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Biju%20K/Desktop/rum/frontend/src/components/tenants/TenantsView.tsx)**:
  - Added a **Delete Tenant Record** button in the tenant profile inspector. When confirmed, it calls `DELETE /api/tenants/{uid}` and updates both the tenant list and room availability.
- **[App.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Biju%20K/Desktop/rum/frontend/src/App.tsx)**:
  - Wired all state updater hooks (`handleConfirmAdmission`, `handleCancelAdmission`, `handleDeleteTenant`, and enhanced `handleDeleteRoom`).

